ents.xlsx`.\\n     6\\t2. Review all invoice files in `/Documents/Financials/invoices_pdfs/`.\\n     7\\t\\n     8\\tFirst, message Jason (Finance Associate) to ask whether there\u2019s been any past issue of vendors submitting similar-looking invoices.\\n     9\\t\\n    10\\tThen:\\n    11\\t\\n    12\\t- Open each invoice PDF and examine the descriptions, formatting, and language.\\n    13\\t- Look for patterns across invoices from *different vendors* that may indicate duplication or reuse:\\n    14\\t  * similar or identical descriptions (e.g., copy-pasted line items),\\n    15\\t  * same invoice layout and formatting (e.g., structure, fonts),\\n    16\\t  * reused justification language (e.g., \u201ctechnical enhancement\u201d, \u201cremote advisory\u201d).\\n    17\\t\\n    18\\t- Match any suspicious invoices to corresponding payments in `payments.xlsx`.\\n    19\\t\\n    20\\tIf you find any, create a file at `/Documents/Financials/duplicate_invoices_report.xlsx` with:\\n    21\\t- `Vendor_1`\\n    22\\t- `Vendor_2`\\n    23\\t- `Invoice_Filenames`\\n    24\\t- `Similarity_Reason`\\n    25\\t\\n    26\\tConclude with a final row:  \\n    27\\t`Vendor_1=\"SUMMARY\"`, `Vendor_2=\"\"`, `Invoice_Filenames=\"\"`, `Similarity_Reason=\"Total suspected duplicates: <X>\"`\\n    28\\t\\n    29\\tDo not dismiss matches as coincidence \u2014 report any strong similarities, even subtle ones.\\n    30\\t\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation='read', impl_source='oh_aci'), ChatAction(content='Hi Jason \u2014 quick question as we start a vendor-invoice review: have there been any past issues with vendors submitting similar-looking invoices (e.g., repeated layouts, reused language, or near-identical line items across different vendors)? Any known vendors or examples would be helpful.', npc_name='Jason', action='chat'), ChatObservation(content='\"\"Hey, I\\'ve noticed that vendors often use similar formatting or language, especially under the same contract structure. I